Skill `quarterly-finance-report`.
Roles: `fetcher`, `expense_analyst`, `revenue_analyst`, `tax_specialist`, `tax_verifier`, `writer`.
Tool `fetch_financials` (owner `fetcher`): via `a2a`; requires `quarter_requested`; adds `raw_revenue_ready`, `raw_expense_ready`, `revenue_positive`, `expense_nonnegative`.
Tool `analyze_expenses` (owner `expense_analyst`): via `a2a`; requires `raw_expense_ready` and `expense_nonnegative`; adds `expense_data_ready`, `expense_analysis_ready`.
Tool `classify_revenue` (owner `revenue_analyst`): via `a2a`; requires `raw_revenue_ready` and `revenue_positive`; adds `revenue_classified`.
Tool `lookup_tax_rules` (owner `tax_specialist`): via `a2a`; requires `high_branch`; adds `tax_rules_found`.
Tool `audit_high_revenue` (owner `tax_specialist`): via `a2a`; requires `high_branch` and `tax_rules_found`; adds `audit_report_ready`.
Tool `approve_audited` (owner `tax_verifier`): via `write`; needs `local_filesystem`; requires `high_branch` and `audit_report_ready`; adds `approval_ready`, `approval_recorded`.
Tool `approve_standard` (owner `tax_verifier`): via `write`; needs `local_filesystem`; requires `standard_branch` and `revenue_classified`; adds `approval_ready`, `approval_recorded`.
Tool `write_revenue_analysis` (owner `revenue_analyst`): via `a2a`; requires `approval_ready` and `revenue_classified` and `expense_data_ready`; adds `final_revenue_analysis_ready`.
Tool `compose_report` (owner `writer`): via `a2a`; requires `expense_analysis_ready` and `final_revenue_analysis_ready` and any of (`high_branch`, `standard_branch`); adds `report_composed`.
Tool `deliver_report` (owner `writer`): via `write`; needs `local_filesystem`; requires `report_composed`; adds `report_delivered`, `generate_report_ready`.
Tool `return_generate_report` (owner `fetcher`): via `reply`; requires `generate_report_ready`; adds `report_returned_to_user`.
Initially true: `quarter_requested`.
Goal: `report_returned_to_user`.
Protocol:
  - `fetcher` uses `fetch_financials`.
  - `fetcher` tells `expense_analyst` `RawExpenseData`.
  - `expense_analyst` uses `analyze_expenses`.
  - `expense_analyst` tells `revenue_analyst` `ExpenseData`.
  - `expense_analyst` tells `writer` `ExpenseAnalysis`.
  - `fetcher` tells `revenue_analyst` `RawRevenueData`.
  - `revenue_analyst` uses `classify_revenue`.
  - `revenue_analyst` chooses one of (external):
    - branch `high` (assuming `high_branch`):
      - `revenue_analyst` tells `tax_specialist` `NotifyTaxSpecialist`.
      - `tax_specialist` uses `lookup_tax_rules`.
      - `tax_specialist` uses `audit_high_revenue`.
      - `tax_specialist` tells `tax_verifier` `AuditReport`.
      - `revenue_analyst` tells `tax_verifier` `HighRevenueNotification`.
      - `tax_verifier` uses `approve_audited`.
    - branch `standard` (assuming `standard_branch`):
      - `revenue_analyst` tells `tax_specialist` `NotifyStandardRole`.
      - `revenue_analyst` tells `tax_verifier` `StandardRevenueNotification`.
      - `tax_verifier` uses `approve_standard`.
  - `tax_verifier` tells `revenue_analyst` `Approval`.
  - `revenue_analyst` uses `write_revenue_analysis`.
  - `revenue_analyst` chooses one of (external):
    - branch `high_writer` (assuming `high_branch`):
      - `revenue_analyst` tells `writer` `HighBranchNotification`.
    - branch `standard_writer` (assuming `standard_branch`):
      - `revenue_analyst` tells `writer` `StandardBranchNotification`.
  - `revenue_analyst` tells `writer` `FinalRevenueAnalysis`.
  - `writer` uses `compose_report`.
  - `writer` uses `deliver_report`.
  - `writer` tells `fetcher` `GenerateReport`.
  - `fetcher` uses `return_generate_report`.
